# Optional: OpenRouter API Key for live LLM synthesis in Autonomous Triage Sentinel.
# If omitted or left blank, the app automatically uses the deterministic physics & statistics report engine.
#
# WARNING: VITE_-prefixed variables are embedded into the built JavaScript bundle
# and are visible to anyone who visits the deployed site. Treat this key as PUBLIC:
# use a dedicated key with a spending limit and HTTP-referrer restrictions, or
# paste your key at runtime via the in-app token field (stored only in your browser).
# Never place a server-side secret here. The app intentionally does NOT read
# non-prefixed variables such as OPENROUTER_TOKEN.
VITE_OPENROUTER_TOKEN=
